            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Sandbox VPN support

- The sandbox now follows your Mac’s IPv4 routes and DNS by default, including VPN routes, so agents can reach resources available through your VPN.
- Use **Settings → Sandbox Network** to switch to **Standard sandbox network**. The setting applies after you restart the sandbox.
- To resume a sandbox session saved before the update, select **Standard sandbox network** first. Starting a fresh session in the new mode keeps files on the sandbox disk.
]]></description>
